msgid "Where the pieces stand; eight ranks from rank 8 down to rank 1, joined by /."
msgstr "棋子所在位置；从第 8 横排到第 1 横排共 8 段，用 / 分隔。"

msgid "w for White; b for Black."
msgstr "w 表示白方，b 表示黑方。"

msgid "Castling availability: K and Q for White, k and q for Black; - when none."
msgstr "易位权：白方 K、Q，黑方 k、q；无则 -。"

msgid "The target square after a double pawn push, or -."
msgstr "兵双步后的可吃过路兵目标格，无则 -。"

msgid "Half-moves since the last capture or pawn move."
msgstr "距上次吃子或兵移动以来的半步数。"

msgid "The number of the current full move, starting at 1."
msgstr "当前回合编号，从 1 开始。"

msgid "Is a Placement a Full FEN?"
msgstr "棋子摆放段就是完整 FEN 吗？"

msgid "No. A Placement only says where the pieces stand; a Full FEN adds the five metadata fields."
msgstr "不是。棋子摆放段只说明棋子位置；完整 FEN 还会加上五个元数据字段。"

msgid "Why is the side to move not recognized?"
msgstr "为什么不识别走子方？"

msgid "A Board image cannot show whose turn it is, so Recognition lets you choose White or Black."
msgstr "棋盘图片无法显示轮到哪一方，因此识别允许你选择白方或黑方。"

msgid "Can I render illegal positions?"
msgstr "可以渲染不合法的局面吗？"

msgid "Yes. A syntactically valid FEN is rendered even when the position is illegal, with warnings."
msgstr "可以。只要 FEN 语法合法，即使局面不合法也会渲染，并附带警告。"

msgid "Tag pair"
msgstr "标签对"

msgid "Metadata about the Game."
msgstr "描述对局的元数据。"

msgid "Starts a full move; Black's reply follows."
msgstr "开始一个回合；随后是黑方应着。"

msgid "One Ply; White's Nth move ends at ply 2N-1 and Black's at 2N."
msgstr "一个 Ply；白方第 N 步结束于 ply 2N-1，黑方结束于 ply 2N。"

msgid "Variation"
msgstr "变例"

msgid "An alternative line; ChessFEN ignores variations."
msgstr "替代线路；ChessFEN 会忽略变例。"

msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

msgid "The Game outcome: 1-0, 0-1, 1/2-1/2, or *."
msgstr "对局结果：1-0、0-1、1/2-1/2 或 *。"

msgid "Are variations included?"
msgstr "会包含变例吗？"

msgid "No. Only the Mainline is followed; parenthesized variations are ignored."
msgstr "不会。只沿主线导航，括号中的变例会被忽略。"

msgid "What happens to a malformed PGN?"
msgstr "PGN 格式有误时会怎样？"

msgid "The whole document is rejected so that no wrong Position is served."
msgstr "整份文档都会被拒绝，以免返回错误局面。"

msgid "How do I choose a specific Ply?"
msgstr "如何选择特定的 Ply？"

msgid "Pick a Game, then click a move in the grid or use the move number and side controls."
msgstr "选择一个对局，然后在网格中点击着法，或使用回合数与走子方控件。"

msgid "Encodings first"
msgstr "编码优先"

